 *
 * ## Usage
 * ```sh
 * deno run -A jsr:@microspec/core/see [--root apps] [--port 8790] [--host 127.0.0.1]
 * ```
 * The product runs it through its dispatcher (`deno run -A .microspec/core.mjs see`) from the product root,
 * so `rt/` is found and `node_modules` holds the framework's runtime files. In the edge repo `vps/see.sh
 * <app> [eye flags]` rsyncs the working tree to the box, keeps one such server running there
